 JSON body with base64 in message. It responds with Content-Type: application/x-ndjson: newline-delimited JSON events (progress, then chunk metadata followed by raw bytes, then success or failure). Optional fields download_id and download_file track progress in the server download queue."},"2717":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-42","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Note that source_terminal is required, but it only identifies which client terminal sent the request. It does not affect command execution."},"2718":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-43","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Invalid JSON or request body shape returns HTTP 422:"},"2719":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-44","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Explanation\nQueues a process listing task for the host, waits for the implant to finish, then returns the stored process tree."},"2720":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-45","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Explanation\nFile browser feature."},"2721":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-46","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Explanation\nScreenshot feature.\nRequest"},"2722":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-47","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Explanation\nLists keylogger captures."},"2723":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-48","page_id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server","type":"text","url":"/docs/rest-api/team-server#implant-interaction","content":"Explanation\nRemoves a keylogger capture."},"2724":{"id":"/docs/rest-api/team-server-49","page_id":"/docs/rest-a